  "html": "<p>Don’t look away, I’m quite sure this has happened to you as well:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png\" width=\"535\" height=\"279.98333333333335\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:535,&quot;bytes&quot;:692747,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://artifactstech.substack.com/i/187427768?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xA0m!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4fc25d9-176d-4318-8662-3eead6e117c7_1200x628.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I admit too that I rarely draft work emails 100% by myself.</p><p><span>But let’s look at the broader picture: </span><strong>we live in an era where producing a significant amount of language with meaning is more efficient and less time-consuming than ever.</strong><span> You can literally get 10 pages of anything in a few minutes by asking any LLM to do so.</span></p><p><span>Yet, </span><strong>this doesn’t mean we’re producing more knowledge or that the amount of meaning keeps pace with the length of the documents spit out by machines.</strong><span> </span></p><p><span>Rather, </span><strong>LLMs are great at producing stuff that makes sense, sounds good, and neatly organises notions</strong><span>, being able to package information either in a few bullet points or uselessly long documents.</span></p><p><span>Not surprisingly, though, </span><strong>the level of these texts can’t help but be average</strong><span>, as LLMs are, technically but also philosophically, </span><em><span>‘</span><a href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/culture/infinite-scroll/ai-is-homogenizing-our-thoughts\">technologies of average</a><span> both in the quality of the writing and in the calibre of the ideas.’</span></em></p><p>(And usually also badly written imho)</p><p><span>Not only creating, but also </span><a href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/culture/open-questions/whats-happening-to-reading\">consuming language</a><span> has been drastically simplified (I swear I wrote this sentence 😅): </span><strong>we may be often asking an AI to help us read and summarise a document that someone else asked AI to make longer.</strong></p><p>Just look at newspapers apps or any reading app or even the iPhone, that now has introduced AIs to quickly give the 3 key points of anything.</p><p><span>I like to call this </span><strong>the accordion of AI language: we keep making texts longer or shorter depending on our needs </strong><span>only cause doing it is very, very easy.</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png\" width=\"428\" height=\"428\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1024,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:428,&quot;bytes&quot;:1130087,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://artifactstech.substack.com/i/187427768?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uxHU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F157cbf39-ed1c-4b5d-999a-5319b785f96d_1024x1024.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">we’re doing this to language</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"subscribe-widget\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidget\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-justifyContent-center pc-reset\"><div class=\"container-IpPqBD\"><form class=\"form form-M5sC90\" action=\"/api/v1/free?nojs=true\" method=\"post\" novalidate=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referral_code\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referring_pub_id\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"additional_referring_pub_ids\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source_post_id\"><div class=\"sideBySideWrap-vGXrwP\"><div class=\"emailInputWrapper-QlA86j\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-minWidth-0 pc-position-relative pc-reset flex-auto-UL7Y7f\"><input name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email...\" aria-label=\"Email\" type=\"email\" class=\"pencraft emailInput-OkIMeB input-y4v6N4 inputText-pV_yWb\"></div></div><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft rightButton primary subscribe-btn button-VFSdkv buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"button-text \">Subscribe</span></button></div><div id=\"error-container\"></div></form><div class=\"animationWrapper-QRL6aQ\"></div></div></div></div><p><span>And so </span><strong>producing simple, beautiful BULLSHIT is now extremely time-efficient, cheap and accessible</strong><span> 🎉 Just peek at your LinkedIn feed if you need validation.</span></p><p>But that’s not as much of a problem.</p><p><span>What’s worse and deeply concerning is that </span><strong>producing language has become a commodity. </strong></p><p><span>Large Language Models have made it so </span><strong>easy to turn a few words of a prompt into newly created language.</strong></p><p><span>Yet, this makes us skip the complex, fascinating process through which we translate our thoughts into language, and thus words. </span><strong>LLMs are our mediums.</strong></p><p><strong>And this means that language is less of a tool</strong><span> - even a technology or an artefact - </span><strong>through which we think and instead just a code enabling communication.</strong></p><p><span>All in all, </span><strong>we can now think less to produce language.</strong></p><p><span>This comes with a few </span><strong>implications</strong><span>:</span></p><p><span>We’re no longer writing but rather </span><strong>‘meta-writing’:</strong><span> we more and more dictate to a machine </span><em>what</em><span> we need to write and maybe even </span><em>how</em><span> and in what style, </span><strong>and then we delegate the act of writing or typing words to machines.</strong><span> </span></p><p><strong>And so we stare at screens</strong><span> while language is being produced by LLMs, skipping the process of thinking through what we aim to communicate.</span></p><p><span>This way, </span><strong>writing is no longer a flow of 1st draft out, correcting it, changing, refining, but a back-and-forth exchange with a machine.</strong><span> </span><a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44222-025-00323-4\">As argued in Nature</a><span>, though, </span><em><span>‘</span><strong>Writing compels us to think</strong><span> — not in the chaotic, non-linear way our minds typically wander, but </span><strong>in a structured, intentional manner.’</strong></em><span> </span></p><p><span>Yet, </span><strong>the ability to iterate over and over on a text quickly</strong><span>, asking an AI to ‘make it more interesting’ or ‘make it sound more natural’ or whatever non-sensical prompts, </span><strong>may decrease the time we spend on and with the language that should express our thoughts.</strong></p><p><span>So we may also understand less about what we’re ‘writing’ about but also </span><strong>devote less care to what we’d like to emphasize and what requires less attention</strong><span>, which is one of the most critical skills of thinking and writing. </span></p><p><span>At its extreme, </span><strong>I sometimes consider writing the process by which we realise that we don’t understand what we’re talking about</strong><span> - and sometimes this is so important.</span></p><p><span>This goes hand in hand with two other critical skills of writing and thinking: </span><strong>the ability to break down complex issues into simple words as well as the ability to write concisely</strong><span>, while not compromising on the meaning of what we say.</span></p><p><span>And still on the drafting and redrafting part, </span><strong>we, as writers, are less and less the first careful readers of what we produce</strong><span>, as we assume that LLMs will never have typos (rightly so, actually). </span></p><p><span>Finally, allow me to be a bit romantic, but </span><strong>writing</strong><span> - like reading - </span><strong><span>is </span><a href=\"https://fs.blog/writing-to-think/\">a great process of self-discovery.</a></strong><a href=\"https://fs.blog/writing-to-think/\"> </a></p><p><span>As I’m writing this Artifacts, I love seeing the mental connections I make, how I bridge different things I read in the past, what a friend maybe told me - </span><strong>I thoroughly enjoy the time and feeling of the whole process.</strong></p><p><strong><span>And I do feel </span><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/family/2026/02/ai-etiquette-friends/685858/\">a sense of care</a></strong><span>, of being clear and readable, so that your reading is enjoyable and an interesting time. </span><em>And I’m sure it’s the same for you, when you write.</em></p><p><span>This being said, I’m not saying the final outcome of what I will produce would necessarily be better than an LLM </span><em>(well, I hope)</em><span>, but </span><strong>the process itself of writing is probably also part of why you’re reading this piece.</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png\" width=\"483\" height=\"400.39903846153845\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1207,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:483,&quot;bytes&quot;:8271171,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://artifactstech.substack.com/i/187427768?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4QoH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe449b185-9b95-4eb2-8823-6076bd5e8acf_2950x2446.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">This is everything that happens before me writing an Artifacts</figcaption></figure></div><p><span>Indeed, I argue that we read what others write cause we’re interested not just in the content of their writing - that could be produced by LLMs - or the information conveyed, </span><strong>but also in why they wrote that something, what moved them, and, simply, in getting to know what they think.</strong></p><p>And so that a text - and thus the language of a thinking process - can resonate and establish a new human connection.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://artifactstech.substack.com/p/writing-is-thinking/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://artifactstech.substack.com/p/writing-is-thinking/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><blockquote><h3><strong>Save for Later</strong></h3></blockquote><p><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/transportation/875799/ferrari-luce-jony-ive-interior-design-photos\">If a Ferrari gets designed </a><span>by the person who created the iPhone.</span></p><p><span>But also</span><a href=\"https://pudding.cool/2023/05/dark-patterns/\"> a collection of bad design tricks </a><span>that gets us trapped into services, so cool! And, speaking of design, </span><a href=\"https://www.ft.com/content/3d19372c-4922-4cdd-896c-8e3a81ecd3ba\">what the EU Commission is looking into TikTok for</a><span>, trying to make it better</span></p><p><span>The truth on the </span><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/02/technology/moltbook-ai-social-media.html\">social media powered by AI agents.</a><span> And where the truth really is between </span><a href=\"https://www.lemonde.fr/idees/article/2026/01/25/entre-grokipedia-et-wikipedia-il-s-agit-de-determiner-quelles-conceptions-du-savoir-nous-souhaitons-defendre_6664020_3232.html\">Wikipedia and its alternatives.</a></p><p><span>AI Safety and where we are at, </span><a href=\"https://internationalaisafetyreport.org/publication/international-ai-safety-report-2026\">with the most comprehensive report.</a><span> While someone bought </span><a href=\"https://www.ft.com/content/83488628-8dfd-4060-a7b0-71b1bb012785\">AI.com for a lot of money.</a></p><p><span>Anthropic </span><a href=\"https://www.ft.com/content/a75555a6-24c3-4468-aba9-7fe12b5def31\">keeps doing super cool.</a><span> Just look at this spot on adv on AI to mock OpenAI:</span></p><div id=\"youtube2-kQRu7DdTTVA\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;kQRu7DdTTVA&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/kQRu7DdTTVA?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><blockquote><h3><strong>The Bookshelf</strong></h3></blockquote><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1080,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:350,&quot;bytes&quot;:166277,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://artifactstech.substack.com/i/187427768?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PXcL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f516323-22b3-4f13-83d3-7103ecc32883_1080x1080.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" widt